        <AnnotationLayout
          Text="Stage 2 - Clean stg_SalesOrderHeader and stg_SalesOrderDetail&#xD;&#xA;Both tables are cleaned in one package because Detail depends on Header:&#xD;&#xA;  stg_SalesOrderDetail.SalesOrderID → stg_SalesOrderHeader.SalesOrderID&#xD;&#xA;Header must be cleaned first. After Header cleaning, any Detail rows&#xD;&#xA;whose SalesOrderID no longer exists in Header are orphans and must also&#xD;&#xA;be removed — otherwise Stage 3 JOIN silently drops them with no audit trail."
          ParentId="Package"
          FontInfo="{assembly:Null}"
          Size="436.8,120"
          Id="d0509abf-0aef-4b00-8a27-e53d9822ccfa"
          TopLeft="30.7142857796684,437.0705878606" />
        <AnnotationLayout
          Text="Cleans both sales order tables in dependency order.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Step 1 - Header:&#xD;&#xA;  Removes rows with NULL keys (SalesOrderID, OrderDate, CustomerID,&#xD;&#xA;  TerritoryID, OnlineOrderFlag) and date logic errors (ShipDate &lt; OrderDate,&#xD;&#xA;  out-of-range OrderDate). Rejected rows → stg_SalesOrderHeader_Error.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Step 2 - Detail:&#xD;&#xA;  Removes rows with NULL keys or invalid numeric values (OrderQty &lt;= 0,&#xD;&#xA;  UnitPrice &lt; 0, NULL discount/total). Rejected rows → stg_SalesOrderDetail_Error.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Step 3 - Orphan cleanup:&#xD;&#xA;  Removes Detail rows whose SalesOrderID no longer exists in Header&#xD;&#xA;  after Step 1. Rejected rows → stg_SalesOrderDetail_Error with&#xD;&#xA;  reason 'Orphan: SalesOrderID not found in stg_SalesOrderHeader'.&#xD;&#xA;  No trimming needed — no string columns in either table."
          ParentId="Package"
          FontInfo="{assembly:Null}"
          Size="458.4,279.2"
          Id="4702aae7-53e4-4623-9abd-3f5851ae2aca"
          TopLeft="456.428572400188,39.9882353242809" />
        <AnnotationLayout
          Text="Logs two separate records to stg_ETL_log:&#xD;&#xA;  Row 1: stg_SalesOrderHeader — valid vs. error row counts&#xD;&#xA;  Row 2: stg_SalesOrderDetail — valid vs. error row counts&#xD;&#xA;  (including orphans in the error count for Detail)"
          ParentId="Package"
          FontInfo="{assembly:Null}"
          Size="341.6,88"
          Id="a77124fa-37ca-4d1c-8a66-b70862a53dfc"
          TopLeft="456.000000638622,330.599999715125" />
      </GraphLayout>
    </LayoutInfo>
  </Package>
